1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,930
- Hey, guys. - Hey.
- 嗨，大家 - 嗨！

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,830
Honey, I got us that room at the Woodford Inn this weekend.
親愛的，這週末我有訂到那個六福飯店

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,800
That place in Vermont? You can take a hint.
就是在佛蒙特的? 我的暗示果然有用!!

4
