14
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,270
Yeah, we want everyone to be there.
我們非常希望大家都能來...

15
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:50,640
As much as I hate to delay your doing weird sex stuff to my little sister.
跟我非常討厭你對我妹做 那奇怪的「性」事，一樣多

16
