I promise I won't do any magic.
我保證我絕對不會表演魔術的

19
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:07,090
All right, we'll stay. We can just drive up after the party.
好的，我們會留下來 還是可以趕過去

20
00:01:07,260 --> 00:01:10,630
Fine. But if we end up not doing this Maxim thing because of this party..
如果派對的事情害 我們沒做雜誌上的事情--

21
