Believe me, that is not why we won't be doing that.
那不是理由，好不好?

00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,020
One With The Cake

00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:19,120
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

22
00:02:03,220 --> 00:02:05,810
You know, Phoebe, when I was little, on my birthday..
你知道嗎，菲比 小的時候... 在我的生日那天...

23
00:02:05,990 --> 00:02:09,150
my daddy would hide a present in every room of the house.
我爸會在家裡每個房間藏禮物

24
