'I'll love you forever. I'll like you for always.
我會始終愛你，我會一直喜歡你

119
00:08:07,820 --> 00:08:09,870
As long as I'm living..
只要我還活著

120
00:08:10,050 --> 00:08:13,420
my baby you'll be.'"
你就是我的孩子

121
