from beyond the grave, Emma.
會是來自我們的墳墓裡

144
00:09:45,150 --> 00:09:50,950
- After all, my parents died very young. - And my cholesterol's off the charts.
- 還有，我父母親很年輕就過世了 - 我的膽固醇還過高呢

145
00:09:53,020 --> 00:09:56,180
Remember, Emma, heart disease kills women too.
艾瑪，請記得 女生也會因心臟病而死

146
00:09:56,360 --> 00:10:00,160
Okay, cut! Great. Great. That was just..
好了，好了，這樣就夠了

147
00:10:00,330 --> 00:10:02,520
- Yeah. - Oh, good.
- 噢！ - 哦，好的！

148
00:10:02,700 --> 00:10:05,190
Ross, don't forget to get a shot of Emma's cake.
羅斯，別忘了要拍蛋糕

149
00:10:05,370 --> 00:10:07,360
- It's in a box in the fridge. - Okay, sure.
- 在冰箱的盒子裡 - 好的，沒問題

150
00:10:07,540 --> 00:10:11,670
You're gonna love this cake. I got it from a bakery in New Jersey, Carino's.
喔，你會喜歡這蛋糕 我從新澤西州的麵包店買來的，加理諾麵包店

151
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:15,140
Oh, my God, that place has the creamiest frosting!
喔，他們有全世界最好吃的奶油

152
00:10:15,310 --> 00:10:17,570
I used to hitchhike there when I was a kid.
我小時候喜歡搭便車去那裡

153
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:23,180
Well, anyway, they make these great novelty cakes..
無論如何，他們做了很多種口味

154
00:10:23,350 --> 00:10:27,790
in all different shapes. And if you give them a photo, they'll copy it in icing.
也很多種造型，如果你自己準備照片 他們還會放到蛋糕上

155
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:32,260
- Did you do a picture of Emma? - Yes. On a cake shaped like a bunny.
-那你一定放艾瑪的照片嘍 -當然，在一個兔子形的蛋糕

156
00:10:32,430 --> 00:10:36,260
Rach? Does this bakery by any chance also bake..
瑞秋，這家店是不是剛好

157
00:10:36,430 --> 00:10:37,990
erotic cakes?
也賣色情蛋糕?

158
00:10:39,770 --> 00:10:41,890
Say, for bachelorette parties?
上面寫：給單身派對使用

159
00:10:42,070 --> 00:10:45,200
Ross, what are you talking..? Oh, my God!
你在講什麼啊? 喔，我的天啊。

160
00:10:45,370 --> 00:10:47,770
They put my baby's face on a penis!
他們還把 我女兒的臉放在「小弟弟」上

161
00:10:50,950 --> 00:10:53,710
Now it's a party!
這才像派對嘛

162
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:56,520
Wait, you guys, this isn't funny.
喔，如果真有那麼好笑的話

163
00:10:56,680 --> 00:11:00,020
If I wanted this cake to be a disaster, I would have baked it myself!
我也可以自己做這種形狀的啊

164
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:04,360
Is it okay that I still think it looks delicious?
啊，沒事，我還是認為很好吃

165
00:11:07,030 --> 00:11:10,860
- Jack, look at this. - I know what you're thinking, Judy.
-傑克，你看看 -我知道你在想什麼

166
00:11:11,030 --> 00:11:14,300
The resemblance is uncanny.
其相似程度非常驚人

167
00:11:16,970 --> 00:11:20,460
I am this close to tugging on my testicles again.
我也差點再度拉我的蛋蛋	

168
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:25,370
Ironically, that was the Maxim thing.
諷刺的是, 那和Maxim雜誌一樣.

169
00:11:27,350 --> 00:11:30,480
No, no, this is not what I ordered, okay?
不是，不是，這不是我要訂的

170
00:11:30,650 --> 00:11:34,590
I went all the way to New Jersey so that I could have the perfect cake..
我特地去新澤西州 只為了我女兒有完美的生日蛋糕

171
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:38,730
for my daughter's birthday. And I need a bunny cake right now!
還有，我需要兔子蛋糕。現在!!

172
00:11:38,890 --> 00:11:42,760
Ask them if it would be faster if we cut the baby's face off the penis..
如果要快點的話，我們 可以從「小弟弟」上取出你的照片，

173
00:11:42,930 --> 00:11:45,590
so we could put it on the bunny.
再貼到兔子蛋糕上

174
00:11:45,800 --> 00:11:48,390
That is a weird sentence.
好像不是很適當

175
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:52,870
Oh, believe you me, I am going to bring this cake back.
我會把蛋糕換回去

176
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:55,340
I don't even want it in my home. Don't touch it!
甚至我不想有這種蛋糕在我家 喬伊，不要碰

177
00:11:55,510 --> 00:11:57,500
I'm so confused!
我很疑惑啊!!!

178
00:11:58,710 --> 00:12:02,170
Yes, I still want my daughter's picture, but on a bunny cake!
是的，我還是要我女兒照片 但是在兔子形狀的蛋糕上

179
00:12:02,350 --> 00:12:04,870
Yellow cake, chocolate frosting with nuts!
黃色蛋糕，有奶油和花生!!!

180
00:12:05,050 --> 00:12:06,880
To be fair, this one does have nuts.
說實在的，這上面沒有花生

181
00:12:14,130 --> 00:12:16,490
Mon, it was nice of you to loan Rachel your car..
嗨，莫妮卡，你真好把車借給瑞秋

182
00:12:16,660 --> 00:12:20,000
- so she could get the cake. - It was nice of her to pull my hair..
-為了她可以換蛋糕 -因為她一直拉我頭髮

183
00:12:20,170 --> 00:12:21,790
till I dropped the key.
至到我給她鑰匙

184
00:12:22,700 --> 00:12:25,930
Well, while we're waiting, you could tape your message to Emma..
你知道嗎，即然閒著 就先錄一段給艾瑪的...

185
00:12:26,110 --> 00:12:29,570
for her 18th birthday, huh? Okay?
十八歲生日 好不好?

186
00:12:29,740 --> 00:12:32,470
Hi, Emma. It's the year 2020.
嗨，艾瑪，現在是 2020 年

187
00:12:32,650 --> 00:12:34,510
Are you still enjoying your nap?
你還在享受你的睡眠嗎?

188
00:12:37,950 --> 00:12:40,350
We're Aunt Monica and Uncle Chandler, by the way.
我們是莫妮卡和錢德

189
00:12:40,520 --> 00:12:41,850
You may not recognize us..
你可能不認識我們

190
00:12:42,020 --> 00:12:45,510
because we haven't spoken to your parents in 17 years.
因為我們已經十七年了 沒有和你父母親講話

191
00:12:45,690 --> 00:12:47,020
We used to be married.
我們本來已結婚

192
00:12:47,190 --> 00:12:51,030
But then we missed a weekend away together, and things kind of unraveled..
但我們搞砸了 我們的一個週末，造成我們分開

193
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:53,690
because of you.
就是因為你!!!

194
00:12:53,870 --> 00:12:57,400
- Happy birthday. - Thanks. Another good one.
-生日快樂!! -謝謝. 又一個有趣的胡扯

195
00:12:57,570 --> 00:13:01,340
I can't believe I taped over my Big Brother audition for this.
我不能相信我竟然錄了這些.

196
00:13:02,610 --> 00:13:04,980
Ross, Rachel promised it would be over by now.
羅斯, 瑞秋答應過這時候應該結束了

197
00:13:05,150 --> 00:13:07,640
We seriously have to go if we want to get to Vermont.
我們如果要去佛蒙特現在該出發了

198
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:11,980
- The last train leaves in a half-hour. - And I have a massage client soon.
-我問過了，最後班次在半小時後 -你知道嗎，我有要按摩的客戶

199
00:13:12,150 --> 00:13:14,750
You guys, just, please, a little bit longer.
嘿，大家，忍耐一下

200
00:13:14,920 --> 00:13:17,580
I promise, Rachel will be back with the cake any minute.
瑞秋隨時會帶著蛋糕回來

201
00:13:17,760 --> 00:13:21,320
Monica, remember the frosting, huh?
莫妮卡，記得該店的奶油味道嗎?

202
00:13:21,500 --> 00:13:23,830
All right, five more minutes.
好，我再等五分鐘

203
00:13:26,270 --> 00:13:27,860
Hello?
喂?

204
00:13:28,070 --> 00:13:30,040
Oh, no, what happened?
發生什麼事?

205
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:32,970
Okay, okay, where are you?
好的，好的，你在哪裡?

206
00:13:33,140 --> 00:13:35,270
Okay, I'll be right there.
我會過去的

207
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:37,030
Was that Emma? Is she up?
那是不是艾瑪? 她起來了嗎?

208
00:13:38,350 --> 00:13:40,250
Rachel got pulled over for speeding.
瑞秋因為超速被攔下來

209
00:13:40,410 --> 00:13:42,850
She forgot her license. I have to bring it to her.
她忘了帶車照，我得送過去

210
00:13:43,050 --> 00:13:48,080
- If you're leaving, I'm definitely going. - Wait, if anybody gets to go, it's us!
-如果你要走，那我也得走 -等一下，如果有人要走那就是我們

211
00:13:48,260 --> 00:13:50,450
We've been complaining the longest!
是我們抱怨最久的

212
00:13:51,260 --> 00:13:53,990
No, wait, you guys. No, you can't leave.
等等，你們不能離開

213
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:56,600
Rachel already feels bad that the cake's messed up.
蛋糕的事已讓瑞秋很煩

214
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:59,890
How do you think she'll feel when she comes back and you're gone?
如果回來時發現大家不在 那她會怎麼覺得?

215
00:14:00,070 --> 00:14:02,660
I don't know. You'll tell us on Monday.
我不知道，你禮拜一再告訴我吧

216
00:14:04,100 --> 00:14:07,800
Joey, you're in charge, okay? You make sure nobody leaves.
喬伊，你負責這裡，要確認沒有人離開

217
00:14:07,980 --> 00:14:09,880
Got it!
瞭解

218
00:14:11,110 --> 00:14:13,080
Hey! Where do you think you're going?
嘿嘿嘿，你要去哪?

219
00:14:13,250 --> 00:14:14,610
To the bathroom.
去洗手間啊

220
00:14:14,780 --> 00:14:19,220
Well, the rest of you get comfortable, because we are gonna be here for a..
即然大家會待一段時間 請當做自己家裡--

221
00:14:19,390 --> 00:14:24,590
- Wait, there's a window in there. - No! He's not getting away that easy!
-等等，洗手間裡有個窗戶... -不要讓他逃走

222
00:14:25,630 --> 00:14:28,990
What are you doing? Get the hell out of here!
喂，你們幹什麼啊!! 快滾出去啊!!

223
00:14:35,300 --> 00:14:38,360
Well, that one did not have Emma's face on it.
那個「小弟弟」上沒有艾瑪的照片

224
00:14:38,540 --> 00:14:40,230
- No, it did not. - No.
-是，當然沒有 - 對。

225
00:14:41,410 --> 00:14:43,500
Well, we'd better get going. It's late.
已經很晚了，我們真的要走了

226
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:47,170
Jack can't drive at night anymore. He has trouble staying in his lane.
傑克不能在晚上開車了 

227
00:14:47,350 --> 00:14:51,310
Last winter I went up on a church lawn and drove right through a manger scene.
去年冬天，我開車經過教堂的草地 然後撞上馬的食槽

228
00:14:51,490 --> 00:14:53,850
The papers thought it was a hate crime.
報紙誤以為那是一個報仇計劃

229
00:14:57,830 --> 00:15:00,350
- Anyway, it was lovely seeing you. - Okay.
-無論如何，很高興可以見到你們 -好的

230
00:15:00,530 --> 00:15:02,690
- Bye. Bye, dear. - Nighty-night.
-再見 -晚安

231
00:15:02,860 --> 00:15:05,060
- Nighty-night. - Bye.
-晚安 - 再見.

232
00:15:05,230 --> 00:15:07,830
- How could you just let them leave? - Hey, hey, hey.
-喬伊，你怎麼可以讓他們離開? -嘿嘿

233
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:11,900
I'm not gonna mess with Jack. He's a great man. He fought for our country.
我不會和傑克過不去的 他是一個好人，為國家而戰

234
00:15:12,070 --> 00:15:15,470
No, he didn't. He pretended to be a Quaker to get out of Korea.
他才沒有呢，他裝成貴格會教徒 才可以逃離韓國

235
00:15:17,140 --> 00:15:22,080
Well, that's it. He's the last one to go. I'm locking you guys in.
夠了，他是最後一個離開的 我把門鎖上了

236
00:15:22,250 --> 00:15:25,780
You do know I can just turn them the other way around, right?
你知道那個鎖是 可以從這裡面打開的

237
00:15:25,950 --> 00:15:28,440
Oh, I forgot you used to live here.
喔，我忘了你以前住過這裡

238
00:15:33,730 --> 00:15:36,290
- Hello? - Joey, it's Estelle.
-喂 -喬伊，我是你的經紀人 Estelle

239
00:15:36,460 --> 00:15:39,690
- Hey. - So how'd your audition go today?
-嗨，你好 -你今天的試鏡如何?

240
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:43,170
- What audition? - The one I told you about last week.
-什麼試鏡? -上禮拜我和你說過的啊?

241
00:15:43,340 --> 00:15:46,470
What? You never said anything about an audition.
什麼？你根本沒有說過任何試鏡!

242
00:15:49,210 --> 00:15:53,740
Let me start over. I just got a call about an audition.
那我從頭說起，我剛接到你的試鏡通知

243
00:15:54,580 --> 00:15:56,520
I think you can still make it.
你現在去還來得及

244
00:15:56,680 --> 00:16:00,680
It's down at the Astor Theater, and you need to have a monologue prepared.
就在Aster戲院，還要自己帶獨白

245
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:03,620
A monologue? I don't have a..
獨白? 我沒有呢--

246
00:16:06,790 --> 00:16:08,990
I got it.
喔，有了...

247
00:16:10,060 --> 00:16:12,160
So I'm gonna take off.
那我要走了

248
00:16:12,330 --> 00:16:14,960
- What? - No, wait! You don't get to leave.
-什麼？ - 不，等等，你不能離開

249
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:18,230
I've got a massage client waiting outside my door any minute.
我有按摩客戶等在我家門外呢

250
00:16:18,410 --> 00:16:21,400
And we paid for a room that we're supposed to be in right now!
我們已經付錢給一個 我們現在應該住在裡面的房間

251
00:16:21,610 --> 00:16:23,100
Well, okay, now..
好好

252
00:16:23,280 --> 00:16:25,750
only one of us has to stay with Emma.
只要有一個人照顧艾瑪就行了

253
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:29,240
Okay, and as the person who realized that, I get to go.
因為是我剛發現這點的 所以我可以走了

254
00:16:29,420 --> 00:16:31,350
No, no, no. No. No.
不行，不行

255
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:34,420
Let's figure out a fair way to decide who's staying.
那我們想一個較公平的 方法來決定誰要留下來

256
00:16:34,590 --> 00:16:36,610
Oh, I got it.
喔，有了。

257
00:16:36,790 --> 00:16:39,850
Okay, everyone pick a number from one to 10, all right?
大家選擇一到十的數字

258
00:16:40,030 --> 00:16:42,550
Whoever gets the highest number gets to go first.
誰選到最大的數字可以先走

259
00:16:44,800 --> 00:16:47,160
- Okay,10. - Okay, Monica picks 10. I call nine.
-好喔，我選「十」 -那我選「九」

260
00:16:47,330 --> 00:16:48,700
Anyone else?
還有其他的嗎?

261
00:16:50,270 --> 00:16:52,530
- No, let's just draw straws. - Okay.
-大家來抽籤吧?	 - 好。

262
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:55,040
Or we could flip a coin and multiply the answer..
或是可以用硬幣--

263
00:16:55,210 --> 00:16:57,770
- I'm begging you to stop. - Right.
-拜託你，不要講話了 - 好。.

264
00:16:57,950 --> 00:17:01,440
Okay, how about this? We got wind-up toys for Emma.
這樣好啦，我們從艾瑪的 生日禮物選一個發條玩具

265
00:17:01,620 --> 00:17:05,020
We can make them race, and whoever comes in last stays.
拿來賽跑 跑最後的就要留下來

266
00:17:05,190 --> 00:17:07,450
Yeah, let's do that!
好吧，就這樣

267
00:17:07,620 --> 00:17:10,520
That sounds more fun than the thing we were gonna do in Vermont!
這好像和佛蒙特的事情比起來好玩多了!

268
00:17:10,890 --> 00:17:14,520
- Okay, everybody, pick your toys! - Okay. I want the dolphin!
- 好，各位，開始選玩具吧。 -我要用那個海豚!!

269
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:17,820
- That's a bear! - I'm too excited!
-菲比，那是一隻熊 -抱歉，我太興奮了!!

270
00:17:18,430 --> 00:17:21,370
Phoebe, you get the bear. Joey, you get the robot.
菲比，你用這只熊 喬伊，你用機器人

271
00:17:21,540 --> 00:17:23,560
- Oh, yeah. - And Chandler and I get the dog.
-哦，好的。 -錢德和我就用這隻狗吧

272
00:17:23,770 --> 00:17:28,170
And the race is going to go from here to here.
比賽就要開始了... 從這裡，到這裡

273
00:17:28,340 --> 00:17:31,570
Now, the one who comes in last stays!
誰最後一名的，要留下來!!

274
00:17:31,750 --> 00:17:33,910
Okay, ladies and gentlemen, wind your toys.
各位先生及女士，捲好你的發條

275
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:38,310
- Okay. On your mark, get set, go! - Go! Go!
-準備了嗎?預備，開始！ -快，快!!

276
00:17:38,490 --> 00:17:40,850
Come on, robot!
不要停!機器人！

277
00:17:42,060 --> 00:17:45,390
What are you barking at?
你在幹什麼啊?!!?

278
00:17:50,330 --> 00:17:52,700
Well, how is that gonna help?
那個動作有什麼作用嗎!?!?

279
00:17:53,070 --> 00:17:56,900
I bought you! How did I forget that that's all you do?
我買了你! 我竟忘了你只會這個動作?

280
00:17:57,170 --> 00:17:59,400
Way to go, robot!
好樣的, 機器人!

281
00:17:59,710 --> 00:18:02,230
Good job, Alan.
幹的好，熊熊

282
00:18:02,580 --> 00:18:04,980
- Hey, good race, you guys. - Yeah, see you later.
-真是一個好比賽 -是啊，那就再見嘍

283
00:18:05,150 --> 00:18:07,140
No. No, no. Wait.
不，不，你們等一下

284
00:18:07,310 --> 00:18:08,780
We didn't lose.
我們沒有輸呢

285
00:18:09,150 --> 00:18:13,480
The rules clearly stated that the last one to cross the finish line was the loser.
規定是說，最後跑到終點才是輸家

286
00:18:13,650 --> 00:18:16,850
Well, our dog never crossed the finish line. So technically..
那我們的狗，沒有跑到終點，所以--

287
00:18:17,020 --> 00:18:18,990
They left.
他們已經走了!

288
00:18:24,430 --> 00:18:27,560
There isn't time to go to the bakery. We're gonna come home.
你知道嗎? 根本沒時間去麵包店 所以我們現在回家了

289
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:30,400
Everybody left?
大家已經走了?

290
00:18:31,270 --> 00:18:36,330
All right. Well, just tell Emma that we'll be there as soon as we can. Bye.
好喔，告訴艾瑪 我們會盡快回家，再見

291
00:18:37,280 --> 00:18:39,210
- Rachel! - Oh, God, sorry!
-瑞秋!!! -喔，天啊，抱歉

292
00:18:39,380 --> 00:18:42,840
I can't believe they gave you a ticket. You're such a good driver.
真不敢相信，他們給了你一個罰單 你真是一個好駕駛人

293
00:18:44,590 --> 00:18:47,950
- Emma's awake. - Yeah?
-艾瑪起來了 -是喔?

294
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:49,780
I can't believe this.
真不敢相信

295
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:53,420
This is her first birthday, she's awake, we're not even there.
在她的一歲生日 她醒來時，我們不在

296
00:18:53,590 --> 00:18:56,830
Everybody left. We still have this stupid obscene cake.
大家也已經走了 還加上這個爛蛋糕!!!

297
00:18:57,000 --> 00:19:00,560
Hey, maybe I can fix that. You know, try to turn it into something else.
嘿，也許我可以弄好這蛋糕 試試看，改成別的形狀嘛

298
00:19:00,730 --> 00:19:03,400
Oh, don't even bother.
已經無所謂了

299
00:19:03,570 --> 00:19:06,000
We've already ruined her first birthday.
我們已經毀了她的第一個生日

300
00:19:06,170 --> 00:19:10,410
And do you know how important these early experiences are, Ross? Very!
你不知道這些早期的經驗 對她有多重要嗎，羅斯?非常重要

301
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:13,600
According to the back cover of that book that you gave me.
依照你給我的那本書背面

302
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:17,150
Rach, she's not gonna remember this.
瑞秋，她不會記得這些

303
00:19:18,750 --> 00:19:20,410
I guess.
也許吧

304
00:19:21,290 --> 00:19:26,920
Oh, I just had such an idea of what this day would be like, you know?
喔，我本來想像今天是怎樣的一天

305
00:19:27,090 --> 00:19:29,260
Emma laughing..
艾瑪在笑

306
00:19:29,430 --> 00:19:33,590
and everybody gathered around her cake, singing "Happy Birthday."
大家圍繞著蛋糕唱「生日快樂」

307
00:19:33,770 --> 00:19:38,600
And then we would all.. Hey, get out of the road, you stupid student driver!
然後--嘿，不要擋本姑娘的路 笨笨的初學者!!!

308
00:19:39,970 --> 00:19:41,300
They have to learn.
他們總要學這點

309
00:19:44,210 --> 00:19:45,610
- Hey. - What?
-嘿 -什麼?

310
00:19:45,780 --> 00:19:47,870
This is not bad.
這不錯嘛

311
00:19:48,050 --> 00:19:52,850
Oh, my God. Look, you made it into a bunny. How did you do that?
喔，天啊。你把它變成兔子了 你怎麼弄的，羅斯?

312
00:19:53,020 --> 00:19:56,080
Well, I just made these two things cheeks.
我把這邊改成臉頰

313
00:19:58,130 --> 00:20:01,620
And then I split this to make ears.
這部分再分兩邊，變成耳朵

314
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:04,430
Well, I am very impressed.
喔，我非常感動呢

315
00:20:04,600 --> 00:20:06,460
Some can sing, some can dance.
有些人會唱歌，些人會跳舞

316
00:20:06,630 --> 00:20:10,190
I, apparently, can turn phallic cakes into woodland creatures.
我顯然 可以把「小弟弟」改成兔子蛋糕

317
00:20:12,540 --> 00:20:16,980
Now, another way to organize your stuffed animals is by size.
還有另外一種方法來整理玩具 就是按照大小

318
00:20:17,140 --> 00:20:20,200
I'm sorry, is this a game for Emma or for Monica?
對不起，這是給艾瑪 玩的遊戲，或是給莫妮卡?

319
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:23,040
Game?
遊戲?

320
00:20:23,220 --> 00:20:27,590
Emma, do you even know it's your birthday today? You're 1.
你知道今天是你生日嗎? 你是一。

321
00:20:27,750 --> 00:20:30,550
One year old. That's little.
就是一歲，這麼小

322
00:20:33,460 --> 00:20:35,660
That's my girl.
哈，這我的女兒??

323
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:38,830
That's how old you are.
這就是你的年齡

324
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:42,440
Did I teach her that? Did I just impart wisdom?
是我教她的嗎? 或是我傳授智能給她?

325
00:20:44,970 --> 00:20:46,600
I want one.
喔，我也想要有一個

326
00:20:47,870 --> 00:20:49,870
Me too.
我也是

327
00:20:54,650 --> 00:20:58,110
There's no one around. Why don't we just take this one?
這裡沒人，乾脆我們帶走她，好嗎?

328
00:20:58,690 --> 00:21:00,710
- And head to Canada. - I was kidding.
-然後跑去加拿大? -我在開玩笑

329
00:21:00,890 --> 00:21:02,380
I wasn't. Let's get going.
我可沒有呢!! 快點出發吧

330
00:21:04,190 --> 00:21:07,090
- Hey, are Ross and Rachel back? - No, not yet.
-嘿，羅斯和瑞秋回來了嗎? -還沒有呢

331
00:21:07,260 --> 00:21:10,960
- Oh, good, I didn't miss the party. - What about your massage client?
-喔，好耶，我沒錯過派對嘛 -那你的按摩客戶呢?

332
00:21:11,130 --> 00:21:16,090
I just felt so bad missing this. So I just slipped him a little something, you know.
我覺得很內疚如果錯過這派對 所以我給他一些東西

333
00:21:16,270 --> 00:21:19,470
As long as I'm back in five or six hours, it'll be all right.
五或六個小時後再做也可以

334
00:21:21,540 --> 00:21:22,970
Okay.
好！

335
00:21:23,140 --> 00:21:27,410
If Ross and Rachel ask, I've been here the whole time. The whole time.
嘿，如果羅斯，瑞秋問起我， 說我一直待在這裡

336
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:30,970
I've been here the whole time.
我一直待在這裡的

337
00:21:31,550 --> 00:21:35,540
Joey, we just saw you come in. You ran past us on the stairs.
喬伊，我們剛看到你進來 而且你跑上來時，在樓梯經過我們

338
00:21:36,560 --> 00:21:40,620
I don't care that you left. I'm just glad that you're here. Thanks, you guys.
我不管你有沒有離開 我很高興你們現在在這裡，謝謝大家

339
00:21:41,060 --> 00:21:43,550
Hey, guys, come on. You gotta see what Emma just did.
嘿，大家過來 你們應該看看艾瑪剛做了什麼

340
00:21:43,730 --> 00:21:45,990
- What? - Emma, how old are you?
- 什麼? -艾瑪，你幾歲?

341
00:21:46,170 --> 00:21:47,960
How old are you today?
你今天幾歲?

342
00:21:51,810 --> 00:21:54,970
Emma, that's right. You're that many.
對了， 艾瑪就是一歲

343
00:21:55,140 --> 00:21:57,910
Oh, my God, our daughter's a genius.
喔，天啊，我們女兒是一個天才

344
00:21:59,110 --> 00:22:00,880
- This means.. - No! No science camp!
-這表示-- -不要有科學的說教了

345
00:22:01,050 --> 00:22:05,640
Damn it! I'll put a candle on the cake.
喔，真是的，我把蠟燭放到蛋糕上

346
00:22:05,820 --> 00:22:11,690
Oh, and, Emma, look at your stuffed animals lined up so neatly.
喔，艾瑪，看看你的娃娃 排的如此整齊

347
00:22:11,960 --> 00:22:13,820
Thanks.
謝謝

348
00:22:13,990 --> 00:22:17,260
Okay, here we go.
好了，要開始了

349
00:22:17,630 --> 00:22:21,970
Emma's first birthday cake.
這是艾瑪第一個生日蛋糕

350
00:22:22,840 --> 00:22:24,630
Go ahead, Emma, blow out the candle.
快吹啊，吹滅蠟燭

351
00:22:24,810 --> 00:22:27,400
Come on, Emma. You can do it.
快，艾瑪，你能做到的。

352
00:22:27,570 --> 00:22:30,670
- What's wrong? Are you okay? - Oh, yeah, nothing.
-怎麼啦，你還好吧? -喔，沒事

353
00:22:30,840 --> 00:22:33,400
These are happy tears.
這是快樂的眼淚

354
00:22:33,580 --> 00:22:35,880
This is just what I wanted.
這就是我想要的

355
00:22:37,620 --> 00:22:39,350
Hey, you made it into a bunny.
嘿，蛋糕已變成兔子形狀的

356
00:22:41,490 --> 00:22:44,950
What is wrong with me? It looked more delicious when it was a penis.
喔，我怎麼啦， 為什麼 「小弟弟」的形狀時看來比較好吃

357
00:22:50,260 --> 00:22:51,920
- Okay, you ready? - Yeah.
-好，準備好了嗎? -是的

358
00:22:52,100 --> 00:22:54,590
- And record. - Okay.
-那，開始錄了 -好。

359
00:22:54,770 --> 00:22:57,130
Big Brother audition. Take one.
試音.

360
00:22:57,300 --> 00:22:59,800
I guess you could say I'm kind of a player.
我猜你會說 我是一個演員..

361
00:22:59,970 --> 00:23:01,960
Okay. Let's..
好了.讓我...

362
00:23:02,740 --> 00:23:05,840
- Let's just try that again. - Okay.
- 我們再試一次. - 好的.

363
00:23:07,410 --> 00:23:11,780
Hi, Emma. Well, your first birthday is over, and..
嗨，艾瑪，你的生日剛結束了 而且--

364
00:23:11,950 --> 00:23:14,080
Go! Go! Come on!
快啊，快啊

365
00:23:14,250 --> 00:23:16,720
Go! Go! Come on!
快啊，快點

366
00:23:16,890 --> 00:23:21,120
Go! Go, Alan! Run, you hairy bastard!
熊熊，快跑啊 你這只笨熊

367
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


368
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


